{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "a20263dc3d30f7245d96390a0edb6ffa84baaa1f654ab061e592e939636af71d", "ja": "～俠気～", "zh": "～侠气～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "cb7f584ca92677ea665d13adb2b99705b27d15ac13ba64b121148c68c4f435dc", "ja": "桃子を助けるため、木下組にカチコミをかけ\nるジュリアと環。戦いの最中、服を切られた\nジュリアの背、ドクロ竜のボディペイントが\n露わになる。それは伝説の極道の証……\nのり子とジュリア、最後の戦いが始まった！", "zh": "为了救桃子，向木下组发起\n突袭的茱莉亚和环。战斗中，衣服被划破的\n茱莉亚后背上，骷髅龙的身体彩绘显露了出来。\n那是传说中的极道证明……\n最后的战斗开始了，诺莉子和茱莉亚！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_06_1001_040tam", "source_sha256": "f6bdeb7a233112ef2502fc48530ad37439e111ce9f9c01f5ae71acb01c31cd5c", "ja": "じゅりあ！　お嬢が、お嬢が……！", "zh": "朱莉娅！大小姐，大小姐她……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_06_1002_050jul", "source_sha256": "6d1d42e4c01a5fa1ae06b106b4557abef346b0a136dafc2f5f45613da721faf5", "ja": "環？　どうした、そんなあわてて……。", "zh": "环？怎么了，慌慌张张的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_06_1003_040tam", "source_sha256": "c79ed8044f559ab66aa0a351ad244da34ce366f07ff7a9dcaba757201b628019", "ja": "お嬢が木下組のやつらに連れてかれたんだ！　このまま\nじゃ、お嬢がなにされるか……！　ちくしょうっっ！！", "zh": "大小姐被木下组那帮人带走了！再这样下去，大小姐不知道会被他们怎么样……！可恶！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_06_1004_050jul", "source_sha256": "c2926c2712f92d8c4cabd21315d3e1a687e9d380b4f28e3e9fb9feec0aa3ddc3", "ja": "チャカなんか持ってカチコミかけたら、\nもう後戻りできないぜ？", "zh": "要是拿着枪打上门去，可就再也回不了头了啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_06_1005_040tam", "source_sha256": "78672363c395e454498608f6277cc902c74dfa471574a40a3a3eae0fdd655611", "ja": "お嬢は任俠として、立つって言ってくれたんだ。ここで\nこぶんのたまき達がふんばらなきゃ申し訳が立たない。", "zh": "大小姐都说了，她要以任侠的身份站出来。要是小弟环和大家不能在这里拼命撑住，就太对不起大小姐了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_06_1006_040tam", "source_sha256": "919ccd5fbc2ce95902be7ba3ba2246e63422a13ebb5efac6b83ecc19194d8a9c", "ja": "けど、たまき達になにかあったら……。\nそのときは、あとのことを頼んでいい？", "zh": "可是，要是环他们出了什么事……  \n到那时候，后面的事就拜托你了，好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_06_1007_050jul", "source_sha256": "df2ff73d977711fcd0d597781ea714472d9086f77e47d2757aa9fd718bf91d0a", "ja": "ハッ！　バカ言ってんじゃないっつーの。", "zh": "哈！少说这种傻话了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_06_1008_050jul", "source_sha256": "b71558446bceb84fb860b7d3e59c94da315aee01d52fecf52bb151f92ce302c1", "ja": "ここまで付き合って、知らんぷりなんかできるかよ。\nあたしも行く！　決まってんだろ、そんな事。", "zh": "都陪你走到这一步了，怎么可能装作不知道。\n我也要去！这不是明摆着的吗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_06_1009_040tam", "source_sha256": "447831592e60f99ddd83bc11939c1a14d8b725b9a9f0742b7cc6a74ae4aaabe1", "ja": "え？　で、でも。", "zh": "诶？可、可是。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_06_1010_050jul", "source_sha256": "741bf8fbe3dffed29e717086fdb41cf1ce166e728ff7478d112e0923ad80a6e6", "ja": "あの嬢ちゃんは、俠気ってやつを見せてくれた。\nこの家ですごした時間は、心地よかったんだ。", "zh": "那丫头，让我见识了什么叫侠气。\n在这家里度过的时光，真是让人感到舒心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_06_1011_050jul", "source_sha256": "e60c4ba7111b4cddfa2a2fb8d9c2a5373787bcadf565a75ee59327620e5e1cd1", "ja": "一宿一飯の恩義。ここで返さなきゃ任俠じゃない。\n……だろ？", "zh": "一宿一饭之恩。不在这里报答的话，就不算任侠了。\n……对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_06_1013_049mom", "source_sha256": "3019cfa2cd086a9844269dd9fac3ac81cfb9294a6d32a97295f1244e453f7e77", "ja": "ねえ……なんで木下組に入ったの。", "zh": "那个……你为什么加入木下组？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_06_1014_043nor", "source_sha256": "5b045f5d0cc09353a32ac14efcf43c4c0019609de2dc9da4620441343c54227c", "ja": "別に木下組に入った訳じゃない。\nアタシは誰とも、盃なんて交わさない。", "zh": "我又不是加入了木下组。  \n我可不会跟任何人结拜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_06_1015_043nor", "source_sha256": "198c3c9de20050be40d9f27ead08ec29228995153dabbea5bb4d691ae7d47739", "ja": "あんたの親父さんとも、それにあの木下ひなたともね。\nアタシはただ、木下組に雇われてるだけさ。", "zh": "就连你父亲，还有那位木下日向也是。\n我只是受雇于木下组而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_06_1016_049mom", "source_sha256": "3b6d2ef145e9c5ab607e79bdd4b8d6e311f8ae6656f276ff7981845d1a1c2eb2", "ja": "じゃあ、どうして……！", "zh": "那你为什么……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_06_1017_043nor", "source_sha256": "9bac49f416402a3a59e3f5683c93e6af5994bee16c9c9c6be6ffa0bb5a9e6eda", "ja": "桃子の親父さんは、そりゃあ、優しい人だったよ。\n……けど、優しすぎた。", "zh": "桃子的父亲，那当然是个温柔的人。\n……可是，他太温柔了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_06_1018_043nor", "source_sha256": "3302d332d29f6dcd933eb113a11699b788ac04e86cd2e5c25d15deda6f221e7c", "ja": "アタシは、あんな小さな町で終わる人生なんて、\nまっぴらごめんなんだ。", "zh": "我才不要在那种小城里结束自己的人生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_06_1019_043nor", "source_sha256": "a5a17b9401f7e716b4660d0ebfe61d7167270d511a0bcf76404af2bd803f49d0", "ja": "アタシも名をあげたいんだ。\nほら、桃子も親父さんから聞いたことあるだろ？", "zh": "我也想闯出名堂。桃子，你也听你爸爸说起过吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_06_1020_043nor", "source_sha256": "a9e1180f03553e0fcc95b416f5fd742e1c05b08a98c1b0c56f6da1ceda97a2ff", "ja": "あの戦争を終わらせたっていう伝説の極道。背中に\nドクロ竜を背負った鬼。そういう伝説にアタシも……。", "zh": "据说结束了那场战争的传奇极道。背上背着骷髅龙的鬼。这样的传说，我也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_06_1021_049mom", "source_sha256": "342b9cb415f1363f10344835a1389de905d472a1a1fd5633c19bff258ce195f7", "ja": "そのために、お父さんを殺したの？\n……そんなことで女があがるの？", "zh": "为了那个，你杀了爸爸吗？\n……就为了这种事，女人就能出人头地吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_06_1022_043nor", "source_sha256": "ba1166a767b068043582fcba50524d455763f0f63b670c401043c5e56da18fa3", "ja": "木下組は金も勢いもある。それに、何より野望がある。\n一緒に行けば、アタシはもっとでかい夢が見れるんだ。", "zh": "木下组既有钱，又有势力。而且最重要的是，还有野心。\n只要和他们一起走，我就能看到更宏大的梦想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_06_1023_049mom", "source_sha256": "a2ad4cc02f9885cbc645500f24c5afe5eadc0d64b71029f0f29045d3eaacefa8", "ja": "それがのり子のやりたかったことなの？　ほんとうに？", "zh": "那就是你想做的事吗，纪子？真的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_06_1024_043nor", "source_sha256": "c4a7ac85a6e3c5a27d568cf99bd194e5f30947b829f733179950e2bf05eb0040", "ja": "もう戻れないよ、ここまで来ちまったからには……。\n極道ってのは……そういう道さ。", "zh": "已经无法回头了，既然都走到这一步了……\n黑道……就是这样的一条路啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_06_1025_049mom", "source_sha256": "a48a33387e12d453f4fb632ec59a7d6308209de48ec190581dfd9737524a4821", "ja": "ばか……。のり子のばか……！", "zh": "笨蛋……典子的笨蛋……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_06_1026_se", "source_sha256": "a6f8d28516d267536d69064832e94e8ff50586a86a26215129573ef1a517fae4", "ja": "ドーン！", "zh": "咚！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_06_1027_035hin", "source_sha256": "8ed03a5a8db31a4ad6314bbed279b804685192a310e9f3e9cab7104f4f90e68e", "ja": "まさか正面から殴りこんでくるとは……\nびっくりだよぉ。", "zh": "没想到你居然会从正面强攻进来……\n真是吓了我一跳呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_06_1028_035hin", "source_sha256": "3f59db9bd2414889818039c69702973bc88e2a37472d64c0955b79bdbda3d1ef", "ja": "だけど、ここはあたしの本拠地さ。\n生きて帰れるなんて、思っちゃいないだろうねぇ。", "zh": "不过，这里可是我的大本营。\n你不会以为自己还能活着回去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_06_1029_040tam", "source_sha256": "8fb2c3f95f87d37ed58089c4838f6c2c89832fecde6be9df0d931fe45977d5fe", "ja": "お嬢！", "zh": "大小姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_06_1030_050jul", "source_sha256": "a190ff67c4ed8dfb07c1eec14b5f23926c02629a5729185ca5ba9e50320cc5da", "ja": "環、下がってな。", "zh": "环，退后。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_06_1031_035hin", "source_sha256": "7045ee7575f1d5cb9323940c8447544853f24a4f7cf8ea898db615b7d0d3db14", "ja": "なるほど、ただのトッパもんじゃなさそうだ。\nのり子さん、出番だよぉ。", "zh": "原来如此，看来不是什么普通的莽夫啊。\n法子姐，该你上场啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_06_1032_043nor", "source_sha256": "496d89a83129d743a8b61fe2bd0e819e4928dc4389b59e21c1638593b8b13997", "ja": "まさか魅梨音組にこんな使い手がいるなんてね……\n見ない顔だけど。あんた、何者？", "zh": "没想到魅梨音组里竟然还有这样的高手……  \n虽然是张没见过的脸。你到底是什么人？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_06_1033_050jul", "source_sha256": "c1d6e877130029467b7320db0fa3392fc704dd4c9c5bac1fc295b44da7df024f", "ja": "名乗るほどの者じゃない、魅梨音組の居候だよ。うちの\n親分がお邪魔してるって聞いてね。迎えにきたんだ。", "zh": "不值一提，只是魅梨音组的食客罢了。听说我们\n老大在给你们添麻烦。我是来接人的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_06_1034_050jul", "source_sha256": "9bdb7ccda567c267d4866a112b0405bd7e061805a06696e835931acf19ed678f", "ja": "素直にうちの親分を帰してくれれば、\n悪いようにはしないんだが。", "zh": "只要老老实实把我们老大送回来，我倒也不会为难你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_06_1035_043nor", "source_sha256": "13d93e08afd5e5825b53f3dad654a409d6a1807826af915eb1f42b891c30400e", "ja": "カチコミかけといて、いうセリフじゃない……\nっねぇぇぇえ！！！", "zh": "都打上门来了，还说这种话……才怪啊啊啊！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_06_1036_se", "source_sha256": "42f39a4819762e3af09b4a8835d2b624ee5300b459ec557b7cb3a839eb9ddde2", "ja": "ガキーン！", "zh": "锵——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_06_1037_050jul", "source_sha256": "1604ac82b475f13157394eaef650c493db1577c650933df1b8374b35c8032b19", "ja": "くっ……！", "zh": "呜……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_06_1038_043nor", "source_sha256": "6131e687210125115bbc7dd3aea82fa28530a1e0727f23c45b40029decd64d87", "ja": "へえ。強いね、あんた！\n倒しちまうのが……もったいないっ！", "zh": "嘿，挺强的嘛，你这家伙！要把你打倒……还真有点可惜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_06_1039_050jul", "source_sha256": "1c2db6372cbbbd12113030d0ef71032772d0d9e17a5afff12882125a1dc2d1d5", "ja": "ッ！", "zh": "呃！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_06_1040_043nor", "source_sha256": "148365d2372d3e92cebd9d2c4f0dc19ff7b85fe61fc938c725449ef83e63ef09", "ja": "……驚いた。アタシの攻撃を五合もしのいだのは、\nあんたが初めてだ。", "zh": "……真让人吃惊。能接下我五招的，\n你还是头一个。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_06_1041_035hin", "source_sha256": "5ee5d3373005acd94ff898ee1b8ba3d1409bd0fbcb31d26caff5b02f56271789", "ja": "のり子さん、なにをもたもたしているんだろうねぇ。\n楽しんでもらってちゃ困るんだよぉ。", "zh": "纪子姐，不知道在磨蹭什么呢。要是让你玩得太开心，可就不好办了哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_06_1042_043nor", "source_sha256": "599343caa373679da9d6c71f8c6347aaec721ed1db2241635e91cd38cd78a696", "ja": "わかってるよ。\n別に、手を抜いてるわけじゃないんだ。ただ……。", "zh": "我知道啦。\n我也不是在放水，只是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_06_1043_035hin", "source_sha256": "3cde89e138e89bd903ff862860cca97454fefa5cffff4a2e5a22a10b18130204", "ja": "そうなのかい。なら、あたしも……\n手を打たせてもらうよぉ！", "zh": "是这样啊？那我也……要出手了哦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_06_1044_049mom", "source_sha256": "9894a41d863c7ffddfdf4bd654513172d0a394bb764490f00dc667c965855c02", "ja": "きゃあっ！", "zh": "呀啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_06_1045_035hin", "source_sha256": "2d4e84b31c6e1a4db70fc8a588a2ba96c119f9d85cb43b3e9bc8d042b12e65e7", "ja": "ジュリアさんとか言ったね～！　一歩でも動いてみな。\nこのお嬢ちゃんの、命の保証はしないよぉ！", "zh": "你刚才叫了茱莉亚吧～！敢动一步试试。这个小姑娘的性命，我可不保证哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_06_1046_050jul", "source_sha256": "3310b0df0de95b78ded69887298c4c20a11b1862e47d0f0fddab3787912f644e", "ja": "く……ッ！　てめぇ！", "zh": "可恶……！你这混蛋！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_06_1047_043nor", "source_sha256": "b9bc97c6ca6a9aefdc7e97baf869016240a9dd37de91dfce7ab4e9ecc1af39c3", "ja": "チッ！　……終わらせるっ！", "zh": "啧！……我要结束这一切！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_06_1048_se", "source_sha256": "c69c4ca342ca83290224289c80b3065a597a4b95642242b6c033c8c9ce77637b", "ja": "ザシュ！", "zh": "唰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_06_1049_049mom", "source_sha256": "fbf22dcd75e3d140dc3fc0e77b87c9a2af0c586090ffa0ceea319b60197c6c86", "ja": "ジュリアさん！", "zh": "茱莉亚先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_06_1050_040tam", "source_sha256": "d32024bf1f87932961aa8e8e8a460ddc522b453fedc9997530132fc7bd19f3c5", "ja": "じゅりあ！", "zh": "朱莉娅！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_06_1051_050jul", "source_sha256": "10ad905604b3186907c24fabc60627f34948fb9b6347ac88ded4f224b53995e8", "ja": "大丈夫。服を切られただけ……。", "zh": "没事。只是衣服被割破了而已……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_06_1052_043nor", "source_sha256": "0202651e3559490b649354ea426e2332c5eda76a2a8d657f902fb14c6d10adef", "ja": "それは……ドクロ竜の……\nボディペイント！？", "zh": "那是……骷髅龙的……人体彩绘！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_06_1053_049mom", "source_sha256": "f70890b7ef333b4d4f18cbeb356c4cf0c486da78fa22a160dfb99d8d4a7e42c6", "ja": "ジュリアさんが、『極道喰らいのドクロ竜』……！", "zh": "茱莉亚先生竟然就是《吞噬极道的骷髅龙》……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_06_1054_035hin", "source_sha256": "62cb8edc8ff6c90ba4816e6ead30defee2cc43a7d0a5876239dba4b290fedf3b", "ja": "こりゃあ、たまげたねぇ。うわさ話だと思っていたけど\nまさかこんな所でお目にかかるとは思わなかったよぉ。", "zh": "这可真让人吃惊啊。我还以为只是传闻，没想到居然会在这种地方见到你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_06_1055_050jul", "source_sha256": "70fa5c3093375d9df801838160414d84103bfa1e8bdc94882a876c89c352610d", "ja": "ふ……どんな噂だか知らないが、昔の話さ……\nこのドクロ竜、好き好んで背負った訳じゃない。", "zh": "呵……不知道你听说的是什么传闻，不过那都是过去的事了……\n我可不是因为喜欢，才背上这条骷髅龙的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_06_1056_050jul", "source_sha256": "570ea07a4d80143dfcc257202cd3a70d4ddb4336728f3126f19b339cf9b46cf3", "ja": "もう……忘れるつもりだった……。", "zh": "已经……打算忘掉了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_06_1057_050jul", "source_sha256": "1ef7780e38920676c469ec96c76402ca87af93f60948e4f4710969850b43d5b9", "ja": "けど、仁義のない連中をみるとうずくんだ。\nこのドクロ竜が、また喰らいたくなっちまうのさ。", "zh": "可是，一看到那些不讲仁义的家伙，我这心里就发痒。\n这条骷髅龙，又忍不住想大开杀戒了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_06_1058_035hin", "source_sha256": "c125dc0a0fb97568cbe347d4f0cfea81fb9de2ab1cf37b3383743933cd01c6ed", "ja": "のり子さん、どうするんだい？\nもし怖気づいちまったのなら……。", "zh": "典子姐，你打算怎么办？要是你害怕了的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_06_1059_043nor", "source_sha256": "d6a9fd973cc72df146ea94e3b03f434a597ad670f220e41cdadf8ec14ae6f69c", "ja": "やめてよ、組長さん。怖気づいてなんてない。\nむしろ、わくわくしてるんだ。", "zh": "别这样，组长。我才没有胆怯呢。倒不如说，我正兴奋着呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_06_1060_043nor", "source_sha256": "270bd7024970a5d4f33316af8c8c2116b7bca6967258e20bbc4117b26c7b2dda", "ja": "敵は強ければ強いほど燃える。アタシはそういう\n性分なんだ。そして今、最高の相手が目の前にいる！！", "zh": "敌人越强我就越来劲。我就是这种\n脾气。而且现在，最棒的对手就在眼前！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_06_1061_050jul", "source_sha256": "fdd4d475180ae068739242073539b33b1944e7a2ef91ea2544b1ecced1790f71", "ja": "引くつもりはないのか。……その組長が、\n本当におまえが命を張るに足る相手なのか。", "zh": "不打算收手吗。……那个组长，\n真的值得你赌上性命追随吗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_06_1062_043nor", "source_sha256": "b68197b1e754c4bcd2719294ecdb269e445977f39bf26cfa21a6e1b6aaa2de67", "ja": "関係ないね！　雇い主のために戦うのがアタシの\n仁義だ！　それに……。", "zh": "那可没什么好说的！为雇主而战就是我的仁义！而且……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_06_1063_043nor", "source_sha256": "5761e1588ca184f349b9a7b22713b0be476006dfe8ac5c656499f8359e052a2d", "ja": "やっと、アタシが本気をだせる仕事に巡り合ったんだ。\n相手にとって不足なし！", "zh": "我终于遇到了一份能让我认真施展身手的工作。\n对手，够格！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_06_1064_043nor", "source_sha256": "d117bb308fa26dd55674195f35b223cff798e49f3a56cab31b44e3eb022a4714", "ja": "お相手、願う！　はああああっ！", "zh": "请赐予我一个对手！哈啊啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_06_1065_se", "source_sha256": "42f39a4819762e3af09b4a8835d2b624ee5300b459ec557b7cb3a839eb9ddde2", "ja": "ガキーン！", "zh": "锵——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
